{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "...What do you get out of this? What's your motive!?": "",
  "Kamurocho's security system is so full of holes, the city should have sunk by now.": "",
  "Don't you feel like a fool for paying taxes when this is what the government has to show for it?": "",
  "A criminal wasting tax dollars on bombs has no business bringing that up.": "",
  "Hahaha, I like your style, Yagami-san. While I would love to debate this further, I'm afraid time's running short.": "",
  "Let's get started! Shall we?": "",
  "This new bomb I've set up in Kamurocho packs a real punch.": "",
  "There's an ox inside the inn. That's where you'll find it.": "",
  "An ox in an inn?": "",
  "Hahaha... Five minutes, Yagami-san. The clock's ticking.": "",
  "(Shit, not again! An ox in an inn... I have to think!)": "",
  "(Shit. I only have 3 minutes. Not good. What does he mean by ox...?)": "",
  "(Barbecue? Kanrai, maybe?)": "",
  "(No, there's too many barbecue places to narrow it down to one...)": "",
  "(An ox... A cow... Oh, Akaushimaru! But there are two Akaushimaru locations in Kamurocho!)": "",
  "(That must be where the \"inn\" comes into play...)": "",
  "(The apartments north of the city...?)": "",
  "(No, that's not right...)": "",
  "(Inn... Hostel... Hotel!)": "",
  "(There's an Akaushimaru in the Hotel District!)": "",
  "(No time to waste! That's where I have to be!)": "",
  "(An ox in an inn... He must have meant the Akaushimaru in the Hotel District!)": "",
  "(Where's the bomb!?)": "",
  "(...There! I found it!)": "",
  "(Same design. I'll just pull the wire out like last time...)": "",
  "(...There! Did it stop?)": "",
  "(Yes, the countdown stopped!)": "",
  "(Phew... It didn't go off...)": "",
  "...You need to stop this.": "",
  "Hahaha, wonderful! You've done wonderfully, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Listen, you son of a—": "",
  "Hold your tongue. If you want something to blame, blame Kamurocho, not me.": "",
  "This couldn't happen if Kamurocho had invested properly in its security system!": "",
  "The automation of our lives... The citizens who accept it! The whole country is at fault!": "",
  "Is that anger I detect? What's wrong, you mad that nothing exploded?": "",
  "Save your taunts. You'll eat those words when you fail next time. Hahaha...": "",
  "Next time!? Hey!": "",
  "(Tch, he's still not done with this? What's his goal here? Damn it...)": "",
  "(Looks like time's... up.)": "",
  "Haha... Glad you decided to answer the phone. I was getting lonely.": "",
  "Oh hey, Tsukumo! What brings you out into the real world?": "",
  "Hehe... Just something that piqued my curiosity...": "",
  "What could you possibly be curious about that a search engine couldn't tell you?": "",
  "Oh, I picked up on this electromagnetic wave with a weird frequency. It's not normal radios or taxis or anything.": "",
  "An electromagnetic wave?": "",
  "Don't make me explain it... Hehe. I was bored anyway, so I figured I'd come check it out.": "",
  "You've gotta be the only guy who would leave his house to check out an electromagnetic wave...": "",
  "(Hm... A blocked number. Is this the bomber again? Should I answer it?)": "",
  "Hahaha, shall we get straight to it, Yagami-san?": "",
  "How many times do we need to go through this? You have a grudge against me or something?": "",
  "A grudge? You're the one who started this, Yagami-san. You disarmed the first bomb, remember?": "",
  "It would have gone off without a hitch, but <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> just had to go and play hero!": "",
  "You're out of your damn mind.": "",
  "Shut up! No more talk! Let's do this!": "",
  "There's a new bomb in Kamurocho... Just one! Stop it if you can, dumbass!": "",
  "Your hint is... The pigeon coos among the cherry blossoms!": "",
  "(He gets more and more cryptic... What does that even mean!?)": "",
  "You seem kinda tense, Yagami-shi. Who were you talking to?": "",
  "Sorry, Tsukumo. I don't have time to explain. See you later!": "",
  "I wasn't asking because I was curious. I asked because that electromagnetic wave I was tracking just spiked.": "",
  "Could be a coincidence, but I think you're up to something, Yagami-shi.": "",
  "Listen, Tsukumo. Somewhere in Kamurocho, there's a bomb set to blow in the next five minutes.": "",
  "A bomb? Hm.": "",
  "Yeah, remember that explosion a little while back? The culprit keeps calling me.": "",
  "Ahh, now it all makes sense! Fascinating! This electromagnetic wave is probably your bomb!": "",
  "Seriously? Can you use that signal to track down where he is?": "",
  "Hehe, easy-peasy. You should still probably go stop it, though.": "",
  "Quiet, you. The crazy shit has been finding me! Anyway, make it happen, Tsukumo!": "",
  "(All right, while Tsukumo handles that, I need to figure out this pigeon cooing in the cherry blossoms...)": "",
  "(Shit. Not good. First let's figure out what the pigeon cooing is...)": "",
  "(Pigeon... eggs? Quail eggs? A yakitori place, maybe?)": "",
  "(No, he said pigeon, not quail. And you don't grill pigeons, anyway.)": "",
  "(Pigeon cooing... Po... Po... Ah...! Poppo, the convenience store!)": "",
  "(Dammit, but Kamurocho has like, four of them! Which one is it!?)": "",
  "(The \"cherry blossoms\" should narrow it down...)": "",
  "(Shangri-La? No, that place is anything but cherry blossoms...)": "",
  "(Cherry blossoms... Sakura... Spring... Grr!)": "",
  "(Wait... Pink! Cherry blossoms are pink!)": "",
  "(...And there's a Poppo on Pink Street!)": "",
  "(No time to spare! I've gotta get to that Poppo on Pink Street!)": "",
  "(The pigeon coos amongst the cherry blossoms... It had to be this Poppo on Pink Street, right?)": "",
  "(There! I found it!)": "",
  "(Just gotta rip the cord like last time...)": "",
  "(That should do it...)": "",
  "Excuse me, sir, what exactly are you doing?": "",
  "Huh? Oh, it's nothing...": "",
  "W-What are you holding!? Is that... a bomb!? Ahhh!": "",
  "No, wait. This isn't...": "",
  "Ahhh! You're the bomber, aren't you!? Police! Somebody help!": "",
  "Hey, no, no! Calm down! I'm a detective, not a bomber!": "",
  "Indeed! This man is not the bomber. Not at all.": "",
  "Tsukumo... Good timing. Did you track the guy down?": "",
  "Did you even doubt it? Hehe. It's that guy. The electromagnetic waves are coming straight from him.": "",
  "Hahaha... Not bad, you two! Quite the detective!": "",
  "You... I'm tired of your games! And the cops are going to want to discuss a few things, so you're coming with me!": "",
  "Don't take another step! You see this!?": "",
  "Hahaha, quite a sight, isn't it? You see, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>I</font_kind> am the last bomb!": "",
  "What are you trying to pull!? What do you gain by blowing yourself up?": "",
  "This town's security is trash! And I need to make them see that!": "",
  "Well, this guy was apparently fired from a security firm three months ago. Does that answer your question?": "",
  "You're fast... And yes. I'm going to teach those money-grubbing sons of bitches a lesson they won't soon forget!": "",
  "I gave everything I had to this city!": "",
  "I created a detailed proposal to revamp this entire city's security...! And they just laughed at the cost!": "",
  "It's clear these assholes won't do shit until something serious happens!": "",
  "You can talk all you want... But I think we both know all you really want is revenge.": "",
  "Revenge has nothing to do with it! I'm sacrificing myself to show the people of Kamurocho the truth!": "",
  "And with that... bombs away!": "",
  "No, stop!": "",
  "I'm afraid that won't work! I hacked into your transmitter and changed the frequency.": "",
  "You're done. Come quietly!": "",
  "Hell no! I'm not going down without a fight!": "",
  "(Damn! Time is... up.)": "",
  "Thank god that's over...": "",
  "G-Guuggh...": "",
  "We go now to breaking news. The man suspected of the bombing incident in Kamurocho has finally been apprehended.": "",
  "The suspect, Ryu Asaka, a 34 year-old convenience store employee, was fired from his security firm earlier this year.": "",
  "According to police, the rejection of Asaka's security proposal was the motive for his actions.": "",
  "Asaka's private residence has been searched, and we are told some explosive devices have been deactivated.": "",
  "Well, it sounds like this is all wrapped up. I owe you one, Tsukumo.": "",
  "Not at all. That was like something straight out of a video game.": "",
  "Well, you hungry? It's my treat.": "",
  "Hehe, nah, no need, Yagami. I've actually got a date with a ladyfriend of mine.": "",
  "What? Seriously?": "",
  "I fixed an issue she was having with her phone at the net café, and she was so grateful, we're having dinner. Hehe.": "",
  "Damn... For real? And you're going dressed like that?": "",
  "She's weird, Yagami. She likes me just the way I am. Even said I was \"cute.\" Hehehehe.": "",
  "Wow. Are you... some kinda lady's man in your circles, Tsukumo?": "",
  "Hehe, what can I say? I must be sitting on the F5 key, because my ass is refreshing.": "",
  "Oh for... Next time I'm letting you get blown up.": "",
  "You're persistent, you know? Who are you?": "",
  "Fuck you! When I call, you answer it, shithead!": "",
  "Whoa, no need to get flustered. I didn't think we had that kind of relationship.": "",
  "If you don't shut that smartass mouth, I'm gonna blow this thing right now, asshole!": "",
  "F-Fine, fine. Let's just talk this through like rational adults...": "",
  "Hahaha... That's better. I'm the one in charge here.": "",
  "But speaking of magnets, you're a real magnet for trouble, Yagami-shi! Hehehe.": "",
  "Ohoho... Ahahahahaha! I think NOT, sir!": "",
  "You there. There's something I must tell you.": "",
  "A disaster will befall you. A calamity of water, to be specific.": "",
  "O-Oh. I've never put much stock in fortunetelling, lady.": "",
  "This is no fortune. It is a prophecy.": "",
  "In other words, I have seen your future. You cannot escape fate.": "",
  "Tread carefully. It will happen sooner than you think.": "",
  "Thanks... for the warning.": "",
  "(She probably preys on people's insecurities to lure them into whatever she's shilling.)": "",
  "Watch it!": "",
  "A calamity of water... Once again, my prophecy comes to fruition.": "",
  "Wasn't that just a coincidence?": "",
  "There's no such thing. All that happens is a predetermined certainty.": "",
  "Oh, I get it. You're in it together with the guy on the bike, right?": "",
  "If you think I'm trying to swindle you for money, you couldn't be more wrong. I only wish to forewarn of impending doom.": "",
  "Oh, right. Sure.": "",
  "Hey! Amane-san!": "",
  "Have you taken proper precaution for the black calamity that will befall you?": "",
  "How can I, when your prophecies are so damn vague! At least give me some details!": "",
  "I'm sorry, but all I can see are shadows of the future. I lack the ability to decipher their exact contents...": "",
  "Ugh, you're useless! ...Huh?": "",
  "A black... jacket?": "",
  "Aghh!": "",
  "What's his deal?": "",
  "That's Meguro-san, a regular of mine.": "",
  "An ill-fated man who's fallen victim to many, many disasters.": "",
  "Though my prophecies have averted the worst of them... I am rather offended that he fails to see this.": "",
  "So why did he just run away from me?": "",
  "He bears the sign of a black disaster. Your black garb must have frightened him.": "",
  "...Poor, twisted soul. He is losing his way, unable to cope with the pressure of fate.": "",
  "Personally, I think all your negative predictions are probably just making him paranoid.": "",
  "...There may be some truth in what you say. I can't say I'm not concerned.": "",
  "Good sir, I have a request.": "",
  "What kind of request?": "",
  "Will you follow that man and shield him from the black disaster?": "",
  "Didn't you say your prophecies are absolute? If that's true, what could I even do?": "",
  "Oh, the calamity will occur, that much is certain. But that doesn't mean you can't minimize the damage.": "",
  "If you're prepared for a fire, does it not minimize its toll?": "",
  "Hmm, I guess that's true...": "",
  "Besides, subtlety is your specialty, is it not, detective?": "",
  "...! How did you know that?": "",
  "It's simple, really... I need only to decipher your aura.": "",
  "I suppose, but you know I'm not a charity, right? So how's a discounted rate of 15,000 yen sound?": "",
  "The price is fair, and so the die is cast.": "",
  "...Something like that.": "",
  "Tell me your name. I am Amane.": "",
  "I'm Yagami. Nice to meet you.": "",
  "Yagami-san. You must mitigate that man's impending \"black disaster.\" Be especially wary of black objects.": "",
  "(That guy went down Pink Street. Maybe I'll see if I can find him.)": "",
  "(There. That's him.)": "",
  "(He already knows what I look like because of that stupid prophecy. I better make sure he doesn't see me.)": "",
  "Hey. How about a drink? It's yours for 2,000 yen.": "",
  "...Yeah. I could use a drink, I feel like I'm losing my mind.": "",
  "Excellent! Our bar is right over here.": "",
  "(Black Alice? No way...)": "",
  "You're not going anywhere until you pay up, you son of a bitch!": "",
  "100,000 yen for a single bottle of beer!? That's ridiculous!": "",
  "You kidding? That black beer is legit! It's made from water by melting the goddamn South Pole or some shit!": "",
  "(The beer is black too?)": "",
  "No way! I saw you guys pour it from another can!": "",
  "Shut the fuck up! Just hand over your fucking wallet, or it'll be your body melting at the South Pole!": "",
  "Hey. That's enough.": "",
  "The barker said the beer would cost 2,000 yen.": "",
  "Besides, baiting customers with alcohol is against the law.": "",
  "...You a cop?": "",
  "I'm a private investigator. I've been asked to watch out for this guy.": "",
  "Oh, a bodyguard, huh?": "",
  "Then you can guard him by paying for him! Leave us your wallet, ya smart ass!": "",
  "This should cover a single beer.": "",
  "W-Who are you!? And since when did you become my bodyguard!?": "",
  "That fortune teller, Amane-san, asked me to protect you. She's the one you should be thanking.": "",
  "Wait... That leather jacket... You're the harbinger of my damnation!": "",
  "I'm so tired of this!": "",
  "Man. All this talk of calamity must be getting to him.": "",
  "(But then again... She called it. Is Amane-san the real deal?)": "",
  "Here. For your troubles.": "",
  "...How do you even make a living?": "",
  "Like I said, I am unswayed by petty materialism. I simply seek to use my power in aid of those who need it.": "",
  "I see. Guess you really are an altruist.": "",
  "But that guy was pretty paranoid. Think he's gonna be okay?": "",
  "He does seem to be a magnet for catastrophe. I shall have to warn him when I see him next.": "",
  "Ahh, that wasn't really what I was getting at...": "",
  "Maybe you could uh, try to soften the blow a little? Phrasing is everything...": "",
  "Hmm. I'll take that into consideration.": "",
  "(...Is she trying to sell me something? Should I hear her out?)": "",
  "(I don't really want to deal with this, but...)": "",
  "What about?": "",
  "Sorry. I'm in bit of a hurry.": "",
  "...Oh.": "",
  "(What should I do? Do I accept?)": "",
  "Sorry. I'm a bit busy right now...": "",
  "Very well... If you have a change of heart, there may still be time.": "",
  "Yeah, I'll think about it.": "",
  "Hey... About that request...": "",
  "Will you accept?": "",
  "(All right. Gotta find Meguro...)": "",
  "Yagami-san. A moment of your time, if you would.": "",
  "Do you remember Meguro-san? I have seen yet another catastrophe in his fate.": "",
  "You mean that guy who's pretty much losing his mind because you keep predicting disasters for him?": "",
  "What's going on with him now?": "",
  "It was not long after you assisted him last time. I was struck by yet another vision...": "",
  "And within, I beheld a calamity of white intertwining with his calamity of black.": "",
  "Black... and white? So there were two colors this time?": "",
  "Yes. Perhaps he will be mauled by a panda, or something to that effect.": "",
  "(Mauled by a panda? I can never tell if this lady's serious or not...)": "",
  "And I assume this calamity hasn't happened yet?": "",
  "Correct. The sign of his calamity was still lingering in the air when I saw him earlier on Tenkaichi Street.": "",
  "Yagami-san. I implore you to help this man. Can you protect him from his inevitable fate?": "",
  "As long as we're talking business, sure. 15,000 yen, same as last time?": "",
  "Yes, that's quite agreeable. Thank you in advance.": "",
  "You said you saw Meguro on Tenkaichi Street? I guess I'll start there.": "",
  "(There's Meguro-san. It looks like he's had one too many.)": "",
  "(Their clothes... Could they be the calamity Amane-san saw?)": "",
  "*hiccup* I'm sorr—": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Huh? Oh, it's nothing...": "เอ๊ะ? อ้อ ไม่มีอะไรหรอก...",
  "What? Seriously?": "หา? จริงเหรอครับ?",
  "Aghh!": "อ๊าก!",
  "What's his deal?": "เขาเป็นใครกัน?",
  "...Something like that.": "...ประมาณนั้นแหละ",
  "Hey. That's enough.": "เฮ้ พอได้แล้ว",
  "What about?": "เรื่องอะไร?",
  "...Oh.": "...อ้อ"
 }
}
